# Agent workflow

- The Cursor Agent runs `scripts/ci.sh`, reads `CI_LOG` / `CI_SUMMARY`, and fixes failures without asking the owner to grep logs.
- Update `docs/AGENT_DEVELOPMENT.md` when process changes; keep `AGENTS.md` as the short entry point.
- Run focused pytest for the changed scope before full CI.
- Do not commit `.artifacts/`, wheels, or local project files (`wordlist.txt`, `spell-sync.toml`).
- Do not claim pass without running the relevant command; include exact command results in reports.

